Fonts vendored in this directory
================================

Inter
  Copyright (c) 2016 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter)
  SIL Open Font License 1.1 - full text in LICENSE.Inter
  Files: Inter-*.woff2

Fira Code
  Copyright (c) 2014, The Fira Code Project Authors
  (https://github.com/tonsky/FiraCode)
  SIL Open Font License 1.1 - full text in LICENSE.FiraCode
  Files: FiraCode-*.woff2

  The OFL requires that this license notice accompany the font files whenever
  they are redistributed. Both license files are shipped verbatim rather than
  merged, because the two texts differ slightly.

KaTeX fonts
  Copyright (c) 2013-2020 Khan Academy and other contributors
  MIT License - full text in ../LICENSE.katex
  Files: KaTeX_*.woff2

  These are NOT covered by the OFL. They live here because katex.min.css
  resolves its font references relative to its own location, i.e. ./fonts/.

fonts.css
  Generated from the Google Fonts CSS the web UI previously fetched at runtime,
  with the remote URLs rewritten to the local files above. Regenerate it only
  together with the woff2 files, since the two must stay in sync.
